#### How it works and what makes it different

Altaeron™ administers advanced alignment therapy. Its adjustable hinge joint mechanism is designed to support the realignment of the big toe and gradually alleviate inflammation.

It helps release muscular tension by simply pulling your big toe back to its natural position, resulting in pain-free natural realignment of your toe joint over time.

This releases years of built up tension, straightens and shrinks the bunion, reduces pain, and prevents further growth to get you back on your feet to stand tall and confident again.

This is a natural and non-invasive way of restoring the natural position of the toe, foot, and reversing the damage caused by ill-fitting footwear or genetics.

- Big Toe Drifts Inward
- Turn the dial gradually to apply a controlled outward pull.
- The big toe moves away from the second toe and toward a straighter anatomical position.
- Adjust the tension to support a straighter big-toe position while worn.

