- **Does AirRelief massage both the foot and ankle?** Yes. AirRelief wraps around the foot and ankle, allowing compression, warmth and vibration to work around both areas.

- **How strong is the compression?** You can choose from 5 intensity levels, so you can start with a gentler squeeze and increase the pressure to your comfort.

- **How many compression modes are there?** AirRelief offers 3 programmable air-compression cycles so you can change the rhythm of the massage.

- **How many heat levels does it have?** AirRelief provides 4 adjustable heat levels so you can choose the amount of warmth that feels best.

- **How many vibration levels does it have?** AirRelief provides 4 vibration levels, letting you adjust the massage sensation from lighter relaxation to a stronger feel.

- **Can compression, heat and vibration be used together?** Yes. AirRelief combines air compression, warming heat and vibration to create a more complete foot-and-ankle massage experience.

- **Can I walk while wearing AirRelief?** AirRelief is best used while sitting, reclining or resting so the wrap stays comfortably positioned and you can fully relax during the session.

- **Is AirRelief cordless?** Yes. AirRelief uses a built-in 1200mAh rechargeable battery, so you can use it without staying connected to a power outlet.

- **How long does the battery last?** A full charge provides approximately 1–2 hours of total use, depending on the settings selected.

- **Will it fit my foot?** The adjustable hook-and-loop design accommodates a range of foot and ankle shapes and lets you adjust how snug the wrap feels.

- **Can I use AirRelief for plantar fasciitis, heel pain or swollen ankles?** AirRelief is designed to provide compression, warmth and vibration around the foot and ankle, which can help soothe the tightness, aching, heaviness and discomfort often associated with plantar fasciitis, heel pain, swollen ankles and overworked feet.

